        "text": "In Claude Code a model switch starts a fresh cache; an effort change keeps the cache on Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Haiku 5.5 and Fable 5.1 or later with an API key or subscription, but not on Bedrock, Google Cloud, a gateway or under HIPAA settings. Spawning a sub-agent does not touch the parent's cache.",
